OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA gloomy,
OL,6,Fcloudy night with spells of rain and
OL,7,Fshowers for some. Areas of mist and
OL,8,Ffog to develop in the south this
OL,9,Fevening, becoming thicker and more
OL,10,Fwidespread overnight. Chilly, with
OL,11,Fsome frost patches for the south and
OL,12,FScotland.
OL,13,
